		{
			dependencies: ["4DFD059C412284D5"]
			description: [
				"Have you found a place to settle down? Even if temporary, a home is not a home without &6&oa bed to set your spawn and sleep through the night&r. Do note that &6&osleep is not always possible, whether from an event occuring that prevents it, or from nightmares,&r though that second one is easily combatted with a proper home and some light, maybe even a pet or two."
				"Regardless, I, Professor Larch, am certain you will find your way through these harsh nights, and emerge from them even stronger than before."
				"If you're struggling to find wool, I suggest you look for &6&owild flax or industrial hemp seeds&r. Both make for a plentiful supply of string."
			]
			hide_until_deps_visible: true
