		{
			dependencies: ["4DFD059C412284D5"]
			description: [
				"[With the addition of FTB Chunks, you have the ability to &o&6claim land&r. Accessing the menu through your inventory will bring you to a small map of the immediate area. Using the left mouse button will let you claim chunks, and the right will unclaim them.]"
				"[Claimed chunks have a number of advantages, with one of the biggest being the inability for mobs to grief them. Perfect for a house you don't want broken down.]"
				"{image:tumblrbumblr:textures/quests/claim1.png width:156 height:90 align:center}"
				"{image:tumblrbumblr:textures/quests/claim2.png width:156 height:90 align:center}"
			]
