		{
			dependencies: ["05B83606164A1853"]
			description: ["You've truly found your footing now. I, Professor Larch, could not be more proud. With that said, you can only experience so much in one place. Yes, you will no doubt want to explore the world, finding structures big and small. Still, the length of travel may be intimidating, but that is where &o&6Waystones&r will come in handy. An elegant relic for a more civilized age, you will be able to &6&oquickly travel between any waystones you've discovered&r. Still, doing so will cost you, though the cost will lessen the further away you are from your destination. With that said, I may have one to spare, if you'd show that you're the type who would get good use out of it."]
			hide_until_deps_visible: true
			icon: "waystones:waystone"
			id: "149BF56B98224AAF"
