		{
			dependencies: ["3B7DF82593D5E9F1"]
			description: [
				"Bundles are fantastic, but they can only do so much. At some point, you'll want more than they provide, perhaps an entirely new inventory? Well, I, Professor Larch, know of a way to achieve this. The solution you're looking for is &o&6A Backpack.&r"
				"While more costly than a bundle, a basic backpack is like a chest you can carry around. Wait, those exist, don't they? In that other dimension? Well, not matter. Unlike said boxes, your backpack can be carried on, well, your back via the curios slot. You can quickly deposit an item by hovering the backpack over it and right clicking."
				"Backpacks are capable of so much, but that isn't my subject to teach."
			]
			hide_until_deps_visible: true
