		{
			dependencies: ["15ACD993630984F4"]
			description: [
				"Feeling lonely in your travels? Perhaps a companion is what you need. For many, this means a pet, though for some it means... other entities."
				"However, I, Professor Larch, am not one to judge another on their tastes. I will, however, suggest a wolf as a companion. They are very loyal creatures, and iconic for a reason."
			]
