		{
			dependencies: ["51489406A1269085"]
			description: [
				"We all need sleep, and that includes our little, or big, friends. A &6&opet bed&r will act the same way for your pet that your own bed does for you, &6&oletting them respawn if they die&r."
				"I, Professor Larch, find this to be a true life saver. You'll know your pet has claimed the bed when Zs appear over their head. Do note the pet will only respawn at dawn."
				"{image:tumblrbumblr:textures/quests/pet-bed.png width:156 height:90 align:center}"
			]
