		{
			dependencies: ["5B9D08BF34A3396B"]
			description: [
				"All good pets need a fitting name! While name tags get the job done, they aren't exactly accessible. To remedy this, we can craft a &6&ocollar tag&r. Not only does this act as a cheaper alternative to name tags, they can also be &oenchanted&r to give your pet a boost. I, Professor Larch, am rather fond of the Charisma enchantment. Crouching will let you see the enchantments on your pet's current collar tag, and exchanging them is as simple as interacting with a second tag."
				"{image:tumblrbumblr:textures/quests/collar-tag.png width:156 height:90 align:center}"
			]
			hide_until_deps_visible: true
