		{
			dependencies: ["15ACD993630984F4"]
			description: ["Nobody is truly alone in the world. Why, just look at the many settlements, villages, dotted around the world. I, Professor Larch, am amazed at the varrying style and scale some of these villages have. They tend to have Waystones, so you don't need to worry too much about the closest one being far, far away."]
