		{
			dependencies: ["15ACD993630984F4"]
			dependency_requirement: "one_completed"
			description: [
				"I hear you. Even with a nice bag and some chests, the items just keep piling up. At some point, you need to get rid of them, so have you considered &o&6selling your goods?&r If you have, then I, Professor Larch, recommend investing in a &o&6shipping bin&r."
				"Opening the bin, you'll find its inventory is much like a chest. &6&oSimply put in what you wish to sell, and when the clock strikes midnight, you will be notified of your earnings, which you can pick up next time you open it.&r"
				"Note that &onot all items are sellable&r, and some items like common ingredients may require more than one to receive any profit."
				"{image:tumblrbumblr:textures/quests/shipping-bin.png width:156 height:90 align:center}"
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			hide_until_deps_complete: true
			id: "30ABD0E686F62848"
