		{
			dependencies: ["64084A2EAFBE2B7F"]
			description: [
				"Have you heard about illagers? Strange cousins to the villagers, and much less peaceful. You might come across a group of pillagers, but beware the one with a banner, for it will give you a nasty omen with its dying breath."
				"&6&oVillage raids&r begin when a player with the Bad Omen effect enters a village. Waves of illagers will come seeking naught but destruction and death, and you'll need to help fend them off. Doing so has its rewards, as you'll be seen a hero in the eyes of the traders. I, Professor Larch, have received many a discount and gift for doing such a feat."
			]
			hide_until_deps_visible: true
