		{
			dependencies: ["64084A2EAFBE2B7F"]
			description: [
				"Do you ever find yourself scouring the town to find that one specific villager you want to trade with? I, Professor Larch, know I do. And to that, I say, \"No more!\""
				"The &o&6Trading Post&r is a block that connects to all nearby villagers, allowing you to access any trade from it. What's best is that you can even filter and search for more specific desires."
