		{
			dependencies: ["58E6B0A4E1DEA998"]
			description: ["With so much to do, even I, Professor Larch, struggle at times to keep track of things. Fortunately for people like us, there is the mighty &6&oClipboard&r. Using it is a simple matter and rather intuitive."]
