		{
			dependencies: ["15ACD993630984F4"]
			description: [
				"Exploring the world, you may notice a gold trim around Spawners. Indeed, these are Multiplayer Spawners, and they have some interesting effects. You will find that breaking it removes the trim, but not the block itself. In doing so, you have &o&6de-activated the spawner&r for yourself. It will no longer activate when you are around, but will still do so for others until they, too, deactivate it for themselves."
				"I, Professor Larch, would also like to tell you that &o&6torches you place near spawners will extinguish after 10 minutes.&r Also, if you'd like to truly break the block for any reason, break it a second time and use the prompt in Chat."
			]
